      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As I remember, this issue happened for more than 4 times…The question is… they might delete or update something suddenly, and we will not know what happened, these will cause to strings unlock or translation disappear… and they doesn't let us to keep a local backup.\n\nMaybe we can ask the Devs for the CSV file… I did once, and no reply to me.",
