      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think perserving legacy strings has its pros and cons. It perservs information and references, but too much of it adds unnecessary work for new localization efforts. A potential sweet spot would be to perserve legacy strings for one or two updates, and delete them at a threshold.",
