  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The string that was previously on the VRChat Plus payment processing screen, which explains what to do if the overlay does not appear, has been removed and a split string has been added in its place.\n\nWe tried to reference it from an earlier translation, but as it had been removed, we had to reference it from a screenshot taken earlier.\n\nPlease ensure that this does not happen again. Each string may have been discussed in some form.\n\nStrings that are no longer used should be labelled 'Deprecated'. That way, when improved strings are added, you can translate them with reference to the translation and discussion of the original improved string.",
